    <briefdescription>
<para>Periodically dump the state of all associated objects into the RMF file. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This is done by calling the <ref refid="namespaceIMP_1_1rmf_1ad6d2441fb928c5ed04c1231864cae1c8" kindref="member">save_frame()</ref> function. Convenience methods are provided to add hierarchies, restraints, particles, and geometries. </para>
